## decide/interview-me

`plugins/decide/skills/interview-me/SKILL.md` is adapted from the
`interview-me` skill in [addyosmani/agent-skills](https://github.com/addyosmani/agent-skills).

The interview mechanism is retained as published: the hypothesis-with-confidence
opener, one question at a time with the agent's guess attached, the
"want vs. should want" probe, the Outcome/User/Why now/Success/Constraint/Out of
scope restate, the explicit-yes gate, and the 95% prediction stop.

Changes made: the cross-references were rewritten to describe tool *roles*
rather than that project's own skill names, the default `docs/intent/` output
document was dropped in favour of deferring to the host project's documentation
conventions, and the non-interactive guard was extended to cover unattended plan
executors.

